    ["向目标快速突进，目标为敌方时，对终点区域内单位造成*d点物理伤害，以*f**的基础概率施加*f秒<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"7\">禁锢</>，并对敌方玩家附加*f秒mul(*d**,*d)<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"20\">减疗</>。随后下砸对周身敌方造成*d点物理伤害，<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">击倒</>敌方怪物，以*f**的基础概率<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">打断</>敌方玩家，同时自身获得1枚<HighLight>黄昏印记</>；当自身是<HighLight>防御形态</>并且目标为友方时，为友方解除弱控、减速，并为其附加<HighLight>瞬援</>，使其buffdisc(*id)，持续5秒。\n<HighLight>输出形态</>下每次命中敌方时将为其附加<Highlight>6</>秒<HighLight>衰败</>。\n施法后若自身未处于<HighLight>力量真空</>状态，则<Highlight>3</>秒内本技能变为<HighLight>王庭号令</>，此时的王庭号令在防御形态下对敌方玩家没有击倒效果。\n\n<FaintYellow>黄昏印记</>\n使<HighLight>终结技能</>和<HighLight>怒意猛击</>得到强化，最多持有6枚。\n<FaintYellow>衰败</>\nbuffdisc(*id)，多次附加时长叠加，最多持续20秒。\n<FaintYellow>力量真空</>\n持续时间内无法使用<HighLight>王庭号令</>。"] = "Dash rapidly toward a target. If the target is an enemy, deal *d physical damage to units in the destination area, with an *f** base probability of applying <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"7\">Imprisonment</> for *f seconds, and causing *f seconds of mul(*d**,*d) <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"20\">Healing Reduction</> to enemy players. Then, slam down to deal *d physical damage to surrounding enemies, <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">knocking down</> enemy monsters, with an *f** base probability of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">interrupting</> enemy players, while gaining 1 <HighLight>Dusk Mark</>; when you are in <HighLight>Defense Form</> and the target is an ally, remove soft crowd control and slow effects from the ally, and apply <HighLight>Instant Aid</>, buffdisc(*id) them for 5 seconds. \n<HighLight>In Offensive Stance</>, each hit on an enemy applies <Highlight>6</> seconds of <HighLight>Decay</>. \nIf you are not in the <HighLight>Power Vacuum</> state after casting, this skill becomes <HighLight>Royal Court Command</> for <Highlight>3</> seconds; in this state, Royal Court Command has no knock-down effect on enemy players in Defense Form. \n\n<FaintYellow>Dusk Mark</>\nStrengthens <HighLight>Finisher Skill</> and <HighLight>Angry Slam</>, stacking up to 6 times. \n<FaintYellow>Decay</>\nbuffdisc(*id), duration stacks with multiple applications, lasting up to 20 seconds. \n<FaintYellow>Power Vacuum</>\nYou cannot use <HighLight>Royal Court Command</> during this duration.",
